lass=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/6c28222a9a47f05579aa76e0e04c5c84.avif?t=1772435335\" width=613 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/d18ca7e769dfb537cdbaad7dbf06adc5.poster.avif?t=1772435335\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/d18ca7e769dfb537cdbaad7dbf06adc5.webm?t=1772435335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/d18ca7e769dfb537cdbaad7dbf06adc5.mp4?t=1772435335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shine light to awaken dimension.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u201cTHANKS, LIGHT.\u201d, shining light reveals the object's hidden 3D form\u2014granting it weight, collision, and reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What looked like a simple square might unfold into a staircase. A thin silhouette might mask a towering pillar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use this mechanic to solve puzzles built around spatial insight, object orientation, and hidden structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about what you see \u2014 it\u2019s about what the light reveals..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/20a7c5e667f9b0a6db10e725aeb35ebe.webp?t=1772435335\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/6dcfa307881b638e169bb575cf2ba2d9.avif?t=1772435335\" width=613 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/696c40a60e1002825e63caeab98099ed.poster.avif?t=1772435335\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/696c40a60e1002825e63caeab98099ed.webm?t=1772435335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/696c40a60e1002825e63caeab98099ed.mp4?t=1772435335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn space into silence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorbing light strips an object of its volume and mass, flattening it into a static 2D state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ball that once rolled now rests. A block once blocking your way now slips between the cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering this mechanic is essential for controlling motion, freezing time, and even navigating through narrow impossibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s geometry with gravity off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/2b19774e47c128709f611f48a72da6a9.webp?t=1772435335\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/53dfb4563f671ce9908b8db2e31445c3.avif?t=1772435335\" width=613 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/c3f793ed16888cf4be5db2dc6b08876a.poster.avif?t=1772435335\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/c3f793ed16888cf4be5db2dc6b08876a.webm?t=1772435335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/c3f793ed16888cf4be5db2dc6b08876a.mp4?t=1772435335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Copy. Resize. Fuse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is not fixed. Use mirrors to duplicate objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim through lenses to resize them \u2014 enlarge a key to unlock the unreachable, shrink a shape to fit the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge two shapes into one to create entirely new tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles evolve by combining all prior mechanics into layered challenges that reward creativity, not just logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/fca6f5f39dfc96d75b521f3525bd130b.webp?t=1772435335\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/4338e11c55894f030fd9125b32e14010.avif?t=1772435335\" width=632 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/f8f05f5b0b9c8f006b08082b7e7a3eca.poster.avif?t=1772435335\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/extras/f8f05f5b0b9c8f006b08082b7e7a3eca.webm?t=1772435335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world built for perfection\u2026 until something breaks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through vast liminal halls designed by a watchful system \u2014 pristine, orderly, and oppressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you follow the Administrator\u2019s plan. But soon, you encounter a glitch \u2014 a presence that doesn\u2019t belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As puzzles begin to warp, the structure starts to fracture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just solving puzzles. You\u2019re navigating a narrative of control, rebellion, and self-awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by backrooms, brutalist architecture, and psychological tension, the story slowly peels itself open \u2014 if you\u2019re paying attention.</p>","developers":["Lightersgames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2544740/header.jpg?t=1772435335","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2544740/2135149531/3c7b5604f70d32a6976bb50c8346087f152d95ca/1758623506/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758624737","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2544740/2135149531/3c7b5604f70d32a6976bb50c8346087f152d95ca/1758623506/dash_h264.mpd?t=175862